  "how many are on each server, for the graphs. No names; kept until the panel's owner deletes them.": "cik ir katrā serverī, grafikiem. Bez vārdiem; glabājas, līdz paneļa īpašnieks to izdzēš.",
  "what you write, who it's about, and staff's answer. Kept {0} days after they're answered.": "ko tu raksti, par ko tas ir un komandas atbilde. Glabā {0} dienas pēc atbildes.",
  "what you write, who it's about, and staff's answer. Kept until the panel's owner deletes them.": "ko tu raksti, par ko tas ir un komandas atbilde. Glabājas, līdz paneļa īpašnieks to izdzēš.",
